{"2999860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "While Mom's Away", "steam_appid": 2999860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Mom's Away is fast-paced First-Person Shooter where you kill players with <strong>toasters</strong>, <strong>pizza</strong> and <strong>satellite dishes</strong>...? Yep, that's right. Forget photorealistic graphics, what players really want is <strong>GOOD GAMEPLAY</strong>, and this does in fact have it <i>(Quality assurance conducted by my friend from 1st grade and a Fiverr guy).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶ CHAOS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/b2116488b72d9e947f5b3761d0285c89.poster.avif?t=1766949124\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/b2116488b72d9e947f5b3761d0285c89.webm?t=1766949124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/b2116488b72d9e947f5b3761d0285c89.mp4?t=1766949124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><i>&quot;With great power comes great responsibility&quot; - Your mom</i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Screw that lol,</strong></i></u><i> take the entire kitchen arsenal with you and dominate your opponents in all sorts of funky minigames.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶ MINIGAMES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/7ef76313fffacc9a04b52174a1b46c64.poster.avif?t=1766949124\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/7ef76313fffacc9a04b52174a1b46c64.webm?t=1766949124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/7ef76313fffacc9a04b52174a1b46c64.mp4?t=1766949124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you thought this game was chaotic enough, just wait till you realize each round here is different 💀 You won't get bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Still not impressed? Look at these super unbiased reviews left by professional critics:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/a8dbf3105c83fa2979b2829e79021d5a.avif?t=1766949124\" width=600 height=250 /></span></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/edf5bdbd89000a263bb7bc3f74ada29b.avif?t=1766949124\" width=600 height=242 /></span></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Mom's Away is fast-paced First-Person Shooter where you kill players with <strong>toasters</strong>, <strong>pizza</strong> and <strong>satellite dishes</strong>...? Yep, that's right. Forget photorealistic graphics, what players really want is <strong>GOOD GAMEPLAY</strong>, and this does in fact have it <i>(Quality assurance conducted by my friend from 1st grade and a Fiverr guy).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶ CHAOS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999860/extras/b2116488b72d9e947f5b3761d0285c89.poster.avif?t=1766949124